  "question": {
    "text": "During estimation of nitrogen by Dumas' method of compound $\\mathrm{X}(0.42 \\mathrm{~g})$ :<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/xUG6ls_FRNeVMid--SfP-Nnddj55OWim0oeWbqqaRIU.original.fullsize.png\"/><br />_____ mL of $\\mathrm{N}_2$ gas will be liberated at STP. (nearest integer)<br />(Given molar mass in $\\mathrm{g} \\mathrm{mol}^{-1}: \\mathrm{C}: 12, \\mathrm{H}: 1$, $\\mathrm{N}: 14)$",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "111",
  "solution": {
    "text": "M.wt. of given compound $=86$<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ecZoMRm6VciURaRvlzu3a89ZGBX5OQvDNCOQN-zxhqQ.original.fullsize.png\"/><br />Applying POAC on ' N '<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />& \\mathrm{n}_{\\mathrm{X}} \\times 2=\\mathrm{n}_{\\mathrm{N}_2} \\times 2 \\\\<br>& \\frac{0.42}{86}=\\mathrm{n}_{\\mathrm{N}_2} \\\\<br>& \\Rightarrow(\\text { Volume })_{\\mathrm{N}_2} \\text { at } \\mathrm{STP}=\\frac{0.42}{86} \\times 22.4 \\mathrm{~L} \\\\<br>& =0.1108 \\mathrm{~L}=110.8 \\mathrm{~m} \\ell<br />\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
